    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Choose two Wizard spells from the Transmutation school, each of which must be no higher than level 2, and add them to your spellbook for free.</p><p>In addition, whenever you gain access to a new level of spell slots in this class, you can add one Wizard spell from the Transmutation school to your spellbook for free. The chosen spell must be of a level for which you have spell slots.</p>",
